	<h1 align="center">Homna</h1><hr>
	
	<p align="justify">My village name is Homna, and it is situated in Cumilla district of Bangladesh. It is a beautiful and peaceful village surrounded by green fields, 
	trees, ponds, and rivers. The natural beauty of my village is very attractive, especially during the rainy season. Most of the people in our village 
	are farmers, and agriculture is one of the main occupations here. The villagers are simple, friendly, and helpful. There are schools, mosques, markets, 
	and other necessary facilities in and around the village. The people of Homna celebrate different festivals together and maintain a strong sense of community. 
	I love my village very much because of its natural beauty, peaceful environment, and friendly people. Homna is not just my village; it is a special part of my 
	life.</p>
	
